        {"title": "would like to do", "explain": "表示想要做某事，比 want 更客气：I would like to join the club.", "examples": [
          {"en": "I would like to help you.", "cn": "我想帮你。"}
        ]}
      ],
      "tips": ["班会发言开头可用：Good morning, everyone. I would like to talk about ..."]
